# Links lychee should NOT check. One regular expression per line.
# lychee reads this file automatically from the repo root.

# Local development URLs from the Docusaurus tutorial pages.
# They only work on your own computer while "npm start" is running.
^https?://localhost

# Fictional example API used in the portfolio API docs.
# The domain doesn't exist, on purpose.
^https?://([a-z0-9-]+\.)*synonyms\.io
